Build a National Resilience & Supply Chain Stability Platform with Cortex AI
Marya Mufti | Solutions Engineering

Developer Guide

Gain real-time visibility into critical supply chains, model disruption scenarios and coordinate response across agencies to enhance national infrastructure resilience and ensure readiness.

A note on terminology: In SnowGov regions, Cortex AI and Snowpark ML capabilities run inside the secure, FedRAMP-authorized perimeter via CoCo. The natural-language chat experience analysts use to query this platform is CoWork (Snowflake Intelligence). This guide builds toward both.

